{"seq":1,"slug":"compute-shaders","title":"计算着色器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics/compute/compute-shaders","wordCount":1220,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"计算着色器\">计算着色器</h1><p>把渲染管线那套「顶点—片元」的图形语义全部拿掉，只留下一个可编程阶段和一片你完全自主分配的内存——这就是计算着色器。它让浏览器里的 GPU 不再只能画画，而能做任何能被拆成大规模并行的计算：矩阵乘法、粒子系统、图像滤波、布料模拟，乃至机器学习推理。计算着色器复用了前两章的资源绑定（<a href=\"../rendering/buffers-bindings\">缓冲区与绑定组</a>）与命令提交（<a href=\"../foundations/device-adapter\">适配器与设备</a>）机制，但执行模型自成一体。本篇建立这套模型的基本单位与坐标系，是整个计算章的语法地基。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>计算着色器的工作被组织成一个三维网格。最小的执行单位是调用（invocation），对应一个线程；调用被打包成工作组（workgroup），工作组的大小在着色器里用 <code>@workgroup_size(x, y, z)</code> 声明；你在 CPU 侧用 <code>dispatchWorkgroups(gx, gy, gz)</code> 启动一个由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">gx \\times gy \\times gz</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 个工作组组成的网格。因此总线程数等于工作组数量乘以每组大小：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{total} = (gx \\cdot gy \\cdot gz) \\times (x \\cdot y \\cdot z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。每个调用通过内置变量知道自己在网格中的位置，从而决定该处理哪份数据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[dispatchWorkgroups gx,gy,gz] --&gt; B[工作组网格]&#10;  B --&gt; C[单个工作组&lt;br/&gt;workgroup_size x,y,z]&#10;  C --&gt; D[调用 invocation&lt;br/&gt;一个线程]&#10;  D --&gt; E[global_invocation_id&lt;br/&gt;全局坐标]&#10;  D --&gt; F[local_invocation_id&lt;br/&gt;组内坐标]&#10;  C --&gt; G[var workgroup&lt;br/&gt;组内共享内存]&#10;  G --&gt; H[workgroupBarrier&lt;br/&gt;组内同步]\">flowchart TD\n  A[dispatchWorkgroups gx,gy,gz] --&gt; B[工作组网格]\n  B --&gt; C[单个工作组&lt;br/&gt;workgroup_size x,y,z]\n  C --&gt; D[调用 invocation&lt;br/&gt;一个线程]\n  D --&gt; E[global_invocation_id&lt;br/&gt;全局坐标]\n  D --&gt; F[local_invocation_id&lt;br/&gt;组内坐标]\n  C --&gt; G[var workgroup&lt;br/&gt;组内共享内存]\n  G --&gt; H[workgroupBarrier&lt;br/&gt;组内同步]</pre><p>这套两级结构（网格里的工作组、工作组里的调用）不是任意的——它直接映射到 <a href=\"../foundations/gpu-pipeline-model\">GPU 管线模型</a> 里讲的 SIMT 硬件，工作组会被进一步切成按硬件宽度同步执行的 subgroup，这一层在 <a href=\"data-parallelism\">数据并行</a> 里详讲。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内置索引变量\">内置索引变量</h2><p>计算着色器靠几个内置变量在网格中定位自己。最常用的是 <code>global_invocation_id</code>——它在整个分发网格里全局唯一，通常直接拿来当数据数组的下标。另外两个在工作组内协作时才用得上：<code>local_invocation_id</code>（在本工作组内的坐标）与 <code>workgroup_id</code>（本工作组在网格中的坐标）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>内置变量</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>global_invocation_id</code></td>\n<td>在整个网格中的全局坐标</td>\n<td>作为数据数组下标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>local_invocation_id</code></td>\n<td>在本工作组内的坐标</td>\n<td>访问工作组共享内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>local_invocation_index</code></td>\n<td>组内坐标的线性化标量</td>\n<td>共享内存的一维索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>workgroup_id</code></td>\n<td>本工作组在网格中的坐标</td>\n<td>计算数据块偏移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>num_workgroups</code></td>\n<td>分发的工作组总数</td>\n<td>边界判断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个关键的实践细节：分发的总线程数往往大于实际数据量（因为线程数必须是工作组大小的整数倍），所以着色器里几乎总要做边界检查，避免越界写入。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"wgsl\" data-code=\"@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; data: array&lt;f32&gt;;&#10;&#10;@compute @workgroup_size(64)&#10;fn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3&lt;u32&gt;) {&#10;  let i = gid.x;&#10;  if (i &gt;= arrayLength(&amp;data)) { return; } // 边界检查&#10;  data[i] = data[i] * data[i];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@group(0) @binding(0) var&#x3C;storage, read_write> data: array&#x3C;f32>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@compute @workgroup_size(64)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3&#x3C;u32>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let i = gid.x;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (i >= arrayLength(&#x26;data)) { return; } // 边界检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  data[i] = data[i] * data[i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"分发与提交\">分发与提交</h2><p>计算着色器运行在计算通道（compute pass）里，结构上与渲染通道平行，但更简单——没有附件、没有顶点缓冲，只有「设管线、设绑定组、分发」三步。计算管线对象由 <code>createComputePipeline</code> 创建，只需一个计算入口，比渲染管线的描述符精简得多。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const pipeline = device.createComputePipeline({&#10;  layout: &#39;auto&#39;,&#10;  compute: { module: shaderModule, entryPoint: &#39;main&#39; },&#10;});&#10;&#10;const encoder = device.createCommandEncoder();&#10;const pass = encoder.beginComputePass();&#10;pass.setPipeline(pipeline);&#10;pass.setBindGroup(0, bindGroup);&#10;pass.dispatchWorkgroups(Math.ceil(dataLength / 64)); // 每组 64 线程&#10;pass.end();&#10;device.queue.submit([encoder.finish()]);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pipeline</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> device.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createComputePipeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  layout: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'auto'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  compute: { module: shaderModule, entryPoint: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'main'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> encoder</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> device.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createCommandEncoder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pass</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> encoder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">beginComputePass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setPipeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pipeline);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setBindGroup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, bindGroup);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dispatchWorkgroups</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ceil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dataLength </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 每组 64 线程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">device.queue.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">submit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([encoder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">finish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()]);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>dispatchWorkgroups</code> 的参数是工作组的数量，不是线程数——一个常见错误是把数据长度直接传进去。正确做法是用 <code>Math.ceil(dataLength / workgroupSize)</code>。提交与读回结果的流程沿用 <a href=\"../foundations/device-adapter\">适配器与设备</a> 的队列机制；把结果从 storage 缓冲拷到可映射缓冲再读回 CPU，是 <a href=\"gpgpu-patterns\">GPGPU 模式</a> 里反复用到的套路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工作组共享内存与同步\">工作组共享内存与同步</h2><p>计算着色器真正强大之处，在于同一工作组内的线程可以通过 <code>var&lt;workgroup&gt;</code> 声明的共享内存协作——这是渲染管线完全没有的能力。共享内存比全局存储快得多，但只在组内可见、生命周期仅限一次分发。要让协作正确，必须用 <code>workgroupBarrier()</code> 同步：它保证组内所有线程都到达屏障后才继续，从而避免一个线程读到另一个还没写完的数据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"wgsl\" data-code=\"var&lt;workgroup&gt; tile: array&lt;f32, 64&gt;;&#10;&#10;@compute @workgroup_size(64)&#10;fn main(@builtin(local_invocation_id) lid: vec3&lt;u32&gt;,&#10;        @builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3&lt;u32&gt;) {&#10;  tile[lid.x] = input[gid.x];   // 各线程把数据搬进共享内存&#10;  workgroupBarrier();            // 等所有线程搬完&#10;  // ... 现在可以安全地读邻居写入的数据 ...&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>var&#x3C;workgroup> tile: array&#x3C;f32, 64>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@compute @workgroup_size(64)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main(@builtin(local_invocation_id) lid: vec3&#x3C;u32>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        @builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3&#x3C;u32>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  tile[lid.x] = input[gid.x];   // 各线程把数据搬进共享内存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  workgroupBarrier();            // 等所有线程搬完</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // ... 现在可以安全地读邻居写入的数据 ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>「搬进共享内存 → 屏障 → 协作计算」这个三段式是几乎所有高效 GPU 算法的骨架，归约、前缀和、矩阵分块乘法都建立在它之上——这些模式正是下一篇 <a href=\"gpgpu-patterns\">GPGPU 模式</a> 的全部内容。当需要跨工作组或并发写入同一地址时，则要用 <a href=\"../rendering/shaders-wgsl\">着色器与 WGSL</a> 里提到的原子操作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>计算着色器去掉渲染管线的图形语义，把 GPU 变成通用并行处理器；它复用前两章的绑定与提交机制，但执行模型独立。</li>\n<li>工作被组织成「网格 → 工作组 → 调用」两级结构：<code>@workgroup_size</code> 定组大小，<code>dispatchWorkgroups</code> 定组数量，总线程数是两者之积。</li>\n<li>内置变量 <code>global_invocation_id</code> 等让每个线程定位自己；因总线程数常大于数据量，边界检查几乎必不可少。</li>\n<li>计算通道结构精简（设管线→设绑定组→分发），<code>dispatchWorkgroups</code> 传的是组数而非线程数。</li>\n<li><code>var&lt;workgroup&gt;</code> 共享内存加 <code>workgroupBarrier</code> 同步是线程协作的核心，「搬入—屏障—协作」三段式支撑了所有高效 GPU 算法，引出 <a href=\"gpgpu-patterns\">GPGPU 模式</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"计算着色器","id":"计算着色器"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"内置索引变量","id":"内置索引变量"},{"level":2,"text":"分发与提交","id":"分发与提交"},{"level":2,"text":"工作组共享内存与同步","id":"工作组共享内存与同步"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"渲染管线与绘制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics/rendering/render-pipeline"},"next":{"title":"GPGPU 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics/compute/gpgpu-patterns"}}